  <name>arzxsh</name>
  <summary>Music player with synced lyrics, crossfade and offline downloads</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      arzxsh is a music player built for listening without friction. Search a
      huge streaming catalog, play instantly, and keep your library, liked
      songs and downloads on your own machine.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Synced lyrics that follow the song line by line, with the accent color taken from the artwork</li>
      <li>Gapless playback with a smooth crossfade between tracks, and radio that continues when a queue ends</li>
      <li>Home with a time-aware greeting, trending songs and top artists</li>
      <li>Artist and album pages, liked songs, recently played and search history</li>
      <li>Offline downloads saved into your Music folder, plus playback of your local music files</li>
      <li>Live visualizer and media-key support</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Everything runs locally: the catalog service binds to your own machine
      only, there are no accounts, and nothing about your listening is sent
      anywhere else.
    </p>
  </description>
